<title>LATVIA: MULTIBANKA IN SIX MO 269,000 LATS PROFIT.</title>
<headline>MULTIBANKA IN SIX MO 269,000 LATS PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multibanka, among the top 20 of Latvia's banks, said on Friday that its six-month profit came to 269,000 lats and balance sheet total was 19.34 million lats.</p>
<p>Multibanka said in a statement that its loan portfolio came to 1.64 million and it had deposits worth 11.58 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
